    coda,
    Matrix
Imports: grDevices, graphics, hdf5r, lifecycle, methods, parallel, Rcpp (>= 1.0.12), stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo, Matrix
SystemRequirements: GNU make
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/franzmohr/bvartools
BugReports: https://github.com/franzmohr/bvartools/issues
